    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bollito misto is the great winter dish of northern Italy, built around the technique of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bollito ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bollito"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": long, patient simmering in a pot with aromatic vegetables until each cut becomes completely tender. The broth is strained and served first; the meats follow. This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The accompanying "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "salsa verde",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "salsa-verde"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is made while the meats cook and served cold alongside the hot meat, giving each bite a sharp herbal contrast."
          }
        ]
      },
